@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Existing recorded reading — lookup, guarded audio and honest absence
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Visitor
participant "useReadAloud / ReadingDialog\nAudioPlayer <<browser functions>>" as UI
participant "readings_api.py\n<<route functions>>" as API
participant "store : PublicWorkspaceStore" as Store
database "Shared SQLite\nreadings table" as DB
participant "Protected audio directory" as Files
activate Visitor
Visitor -> UI : request recorded reading for text/language
activate UI
UI -> API : POST /api/readings/lookup\nOrigin + cookie + CSRF
activate API
note over API : Boundary checks passed. ReadingLookup.lookup_key() normalizes\ncase/apostrophes/spacing, retains punctuation and includes language.
API -> DB : SELECT * FROM readings WHERE key=?\nunder store.lock()/connection()
activate DB
DB --> API : row, or no matching reading
deactivate DB
opt row exists
  note over API : StoredReading validates identity; _view() builds ReadingView.
  API -> Store : ownership("reading", record.id)
  activate Store
  Store --> API : redacted Ownership
  deactivate Store
end
API --> UI : ReadingSearch(reading=ReadingView or null)
deactivate API
alt matching recording exists
  UI -> API : GET /api/readings/{id}/audio\nnative audio playback/download
  activate API
  API -> DB : SELECT * FROM readings WHERE id=?\n_find() under the shared lock
  activate DB
  DB --> API : validated record, or no longer present
  deactivate DB
  opt record still exists
    API -> Files : check non-symlink, existing file,\nresolved path inside store.audio_dir
    activate Files
    Files --> API : safe file path, or rejection
    deactivate Files
  end
  API --> UI : FileResponse streaming existing audio, or 404
  deactivate API
  note over UI : Native controls/download; autoplay failure offers manual play.\nMissing/damaged/unsupported media is an explicit playback error.
else no matching recording
  note over UI : Show "No voice recording is available".\nNo synthesis, capture, upload or cloning fallback.
end
UI --> Visitor : existing audio controls or clear unavailable/error state
deactivate UI
deactivate Visitor
legend bottom
  The browser hook name speak() selects a saved-reading lookup; it does not synthesize speech.
  Public ownership redaction never rewrites historical creator records.
  Collection attachment playback uses the separate read-only GET /api/dataset/{id}/audio route.
endlegend
@enduml
